  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0035, merged in PR #4181): the stable_id hash must carry the full scope chain, enclosing functions included, so same-name locals in different functions can no longer collapse. This item is now a straightforward conformance fix to the ruled contract; waits on the implementing fix."  # 8d59
